Can you explain the concept of artificial intelligence?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Artificial intelligence (AI) refers to the ability of machines to perform tasks that would normally require human intelligence, such as visual perception, speech recognition, decision-making, and natural language processing. AI systems are typically designed using machine learning algorithms, which allow them to improve their performance over time by learning from data. Some of the most common applications of AI today include virtual assistants, self-driving cars, and predictive analytics tools used in business. <|endoftext|>
