4. Pour the water from the 3-ounce cup back into the 5-ounce cup.
5. The 5-ounce cup now has 4 ounces of water and the 3-ounce cup has 1 ounce of water.
6. Pour the water from the 5-ounce cup into the 3-ounce cup until it is full.
7. The 3-ounce cup now has 3 ounces of water and the 5-ounce cup has 1 ounce of water.
8. Pour the water from the 3-ounce cup into the 5-ounce cup until it is full.
9. The 5-ounce cup now has 2 ounces of water and the 3-ounce cup has 2 ounces of water.
