3. Pour the remaining 2 ounces of water from the 5-ounce cup into the 8-ounce cup with 3 ounces of water. This gives you 5 ounces of water in the 8-ounce cup and leaves 1 ounce of water in the 5-ounce cup.
4. Pour the water from the 8-ounce cup into the 5-ounce cup until it is full. This leaves 4 ounces of water in the 8-ounce cup and fills the 5-ounce cup completely.
