- Codecademy: Codecademy offers an interactive Python course that covers the basics of programming, data manipulation, and web scraping.
- Coursera: Coursera offers several Python courses from top universities, including "Programming for Everybody" by the University of Michigan and "Python for Data Science" by IBM.
- edX: edX offers several Python courses as well, including "Introduction to Python for Data Science" by Microsoft and "Python Basics for Data Science" by IBM.
- Python.org: The official Python website has a list of recommended books and tutorials for learning the language.

Of course, there are many other resources available depending on your learning style and goals. It's always a good idea to start with the basics and build from there, practicing regularly and challenging yourself with new projects and problems. Good luck with your learning journey! <|endoftext|>
