Can you explain the difference between active and passive voice in writing?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
In active voice, the subject performs the action of the verb. In passive voice, the subject receives the action of the verb. For example, "John hit the ball" is in active voice, while "The ball was hit by John" is in passive voice. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>
<|user|>
