Suppose you have a basket of apples with varying weights and prices. The table below shows the information about the apples in the basket.
| Apple | Weight (kg) | Price (dollars per kg) |
|--------|------------|-----------------------|
| Apple 1| 1.5 | 5 |
| Apple 2| 0.5 | 7 |
| Apple 3| 1.0 | 4 |
| Apple 4| 0.8 | 6 |
| Apple 5| 0.7 | 5 |
| Apple 6| 0.9 | 8 |
