1. The ruby (love) must be inserted before the sapphire (hate). Therefore, the ruby must be in the first or second slot.
2. The emerald (fear) must be inserted after the sapphire (hate). Therefore, the sapphire must be in the second slot and the emerald must be in the third slot.
