Sure! Here are the steps to obtain exactly 4 liters of Chrononium and 6 liters of water without mixing them:
1. Pour 3 liters of Chrononium from the 7-liter bucket into the 3-liter bucket. Now, the 7-liter bucket has 4 liters of Chrononium left.
2. Transfer the Chrononium from the 3-liter bucket back into the 7-liter bucket.
3. Fill the 3-liter bucket with water from the 7-liter bucket. Now, the 7-liter bucket has 4 liters of Chrononium and 4 liters of water, and the 3-liter bucket has 3 liters of water.
4. Pour the water from the 3-liter bucket into the 7-liter bucket, leaving 1 liter of water in the 3-liter bucket.
5. Transfer the Chrononium from the 7-liter bucket to the 3-liter bucket until it is full. There will be 1 liter of Chrononium left in the 7-liter bucket.
6. Empty the 3-liter bucket and pour the remaining Chrononium from the 7-liter bucket into it.
7. Refill the 7-liter bucket with water and pour 2 liters of water from it into the 3-liter bucket. Now, the 7-liter bucket has 3 liters of water, and the 3-liter bucket has 6 liters of water and 4 liters of Chrononium.

By following these steps, we have obtained exactly 4 liters of Chrononium and 6 liters of water without mixing them, and we can use them to make the potion for eternal youth. <|endoftext|>
