<|end|>
<|asst|>
To create an interactive HTML page with headings, subheadings, images, and a table, you can use HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Here's an example of what the HTML code might look like:
```

Tips for Saving Money on Vacation

Tips for Saving Money on Vacation
=================================
Destinations
------------
* [Disney World](#disney)
* [Yellowstone National Park](#yellowstone)
* [Beach Vacation](#beach)
Disney World
------------
Disney World can be an expensive vacation, but there are ways to save money. Here are some tips:
* Stay at a hotel off-site
* Bring your own snacks and drinks into the park
* Use FastPass+ to avoid long lines
### Low-Cost Food Options:
* Bring your own snacks and drinks into the park
* Eat at quick-service restaurants instead of table-service restaurants
* Share meals with your family
### Low-Cost Activities:
* Watch the parades and shows
* Explore the different lands in the park
* Take advantage of free activities like Sorcerers of the Magic Kingdom
Yellowstone National Park
-------------------------
Yellowstone National Park is a great vacation for families who love the outdoors. Here are some tips for saving money:
* Camp instead of staying in a hotel
* Bring your own food and drinks
* Take advantage of free activities like hiking and wildlife watching
### Low-Cost Food Options:
* Bring your own food and drinks
* Use a camp stove to cook meals
* Visit grocery stores in nearby towns instead of eating at restaurants
### Low-Cost Activities:
* Go hiking on the park's many trails
* Attend ranger-led programs
* Watch wildlife in their natural habitat
Beach Vacation
--------------
A beach vacation can be a great way to relax and have fun with your family. Here are some tips for saving money:
* Stay at a hotel or rental property that's not right on the beach
* Bring your own food and drinks to the beach
* Take advantage of free activities like swimming and building sandcastles
### Low-Cost Food Options:
* Bring your own food and drinks to the beach
* Visit grocery stores in nearby towns instead of eating at restaurants
* Use a cooler to keep food and drinks cold
### Low-Cost Activities:
* Swim in the ocean or pool
* Build sandcastles
* Take walks on the beach
