4. Offer discounts or referral incentives to current customers who bring in new business.
5. Host virtual events, such as webinars or Q&A sessions, to build relationships with your audience and establish yourself as an authority in the industry.
6. Collaborate with complementary businesses, such as healthy meal delivery services or activewear brands, to offer bundled packages and cross-promote each other's services.
By implementing these strategies, you can attract new customers and strengthen relationships with your existing ones, leading to long-term success for your business. <|endoftext|>
