 + " a hidden trail and decide to follow it. As they walk deeper into the forest, the" 
 + " trees start to thin out and a clearing appears. In the center of the clearing," 
 + " there is a beautiful, shimmering lake at " + lake + ". Suddenly, they hear a faint" 
 + " melody coming from the other side of the lake. Jill and Harry are curious and decide" 
 + " to investigate. As they approach the other side of the lake, they discover a group" 
 + " of fairies playing instruments and singing. The fairies welcome Jill and Harry to" 
 + " join in their musical revelry.");
 }
 
 public static String generateTrailSegment() {
