 "a fallen tree", "a patch of mushrooms", "a swarm of mosquitoes", "a sun-dappled clearing", 
 "a steep incline", "a babbling brook"};
 return segments[rand.nextInt(segments.length)];
 }
 
 public static String generateLakeLocation() {
 Random rand = new Random();
