Equation (encrypted) | Solution
--------- | --------
4x + 3 = 19 | 
5x - 2/3 = 30/3 
(3x + 5)^2 - 64 = 121 
8/3 - (x/4) = 5/6 
3/4 * (5x + 2) - 1/2 = 7 
(2/3)^x = 8 
2(x + 3) - 3(2x - 1) = 4x + 9 
4x^2 + 9x - 2 = 0 
(x + 2)(x - 4) = 0 
log base 2 (x + 1) = 4 
