Sure, I can help you with that. 
Here are the solutions to the encrypted equations:
Equation (encrypted) | Solution
--------- | --------
4x + 3 = 19 | x = 4 
5x - 2/3 = 30/3 | x = 4 
(3x + 5)^2 - 64 = 121 | x = 2 
8/3 - (x/4) = 5/6 | x = 2 
3/4 * (5x + 2) - 1/2 = 7 | x = 2 
(2/3)^x = 8 | x = 3 
2(x + 3) - 3(2x - 1) = 4x + 9 | x = 2 
4x^2 + 9x - 2 = 0 | x = 1/2 or -2 
(x + 2)(x - 4) = 0 | x = -2 or 4 
log base 2 (x + 1) = 4 | x = 15 
The first letter of each solution (in order) spells out the secret word: MESSAGE. <|endoftext|>
