<|end|>
<|user|>
Can you explain how blockchain technology works?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Blockchain technology is a distributed ledger system that allows multiple parties to verify and record digital transactions without the need for a central authority. Each block in the chain contains a cryptographic hash of the previous block along with new transaction data, creating an immutable record of all transactions on the network. The decentralized nature of the blockchain makes it secure, transparent, and resistant to tampering. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>


