2. Banana: 1/4 cup of mashed banana can be used to replace one egg.

3. Flaxseed: Mix 1 tablespoon of ground flaxseed with 3 tablespoons of water to replace one egg.

4. Silken tofu: 1/4 cup of pureed silken tofu can be used to replace one egg.

5. Aquafaba: This is the liquid that comes in a can of chickpeas. 3 tablespoons of aquafaba can be used to replace one egg.

6. Baking powder and oil: Mix 2 tablespoons of water, 1 teaspoon of oil, and 2 teaspoons of baking powder to replace one egg. <|endoftext|>
