<|user|>
I'm curious about the education system in Japan. Can you give me an overview?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Sure! Education is highly valued in Japan, and the country has an extensive and rigorous education system. Students attend six years of elementary school, three years of junior high school, and three years of high school. Following high school, students have the option of attending a university or vocational school. The education system places a strong emphasis on discipline, hard work, and respect for authority. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>


