1. Start by completing the first odd-numbered task. This will earn you some points.
2. Next, skip the next odd-numbered task and move on to the following even-numbered task. This will allow you to fulfill the second rule.
3. Continue this pattern of completing odd-numbered tasks and skipping even-numbered tasks until you have completed all odd-numbered tasks.
4. Once you have completed all odd-numbered tasks, you will have earned the maximum number of points possible from them. Now, you can move on to completing the even-numbered tasks in order, following the second rule.
5. Be sure to keep track of which tasks you have completed so that you don't accidentally repeat any.
By following this strategy, you will be able to complete all tasks and earn the maximum number of points possible. <|endoftext|>
