Can you identify the output of the following Swift code? 
let nums = [1, 3, 2, 5, 4]
let sortedNums = nums.sorted()
let sum = nums.reduce(0, +)
let reversedNums = nums.reversed()
print(sortedNums)
print(sum)
print(reversedNums)
Hint: The output will contain the sorted list of nums, the sum of all elements in nums, and the reversed list of nums.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
