 if result2 == 0:
 unique_weight = group6[6]
 elif result2 == 1:
 unique_weight = group6[0]
 else:
 unique_weight = group6[2]
```
5. Weigh the unique weight against any other suspect to determine if it is heavier or lighter.
```
result3 = compare([unique_weight], [suspects[0]])
if result3 == 0:
 print("The unique weight is suspect", unique_weight)
elif result3 == 1:
 print("The unique weight is heavier and is suspect", unique_weight)
else:
 print("The unique weight is lighter and is suspect", unique_weight)
```
As before, note that you will need to define the `compare` function to compare the weights of two groups or two suspects. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>


