FROM stock_exchanges
WHERE return_on_investment > (SELECT return_on_investment
 FROM stock_exchanges
 WHERE exchange_name = 'Nasdaq')
ORDER BY return_on_investment DESC;
```
This query would show a list of stock exchanges with a higher return on investment than Nasdaq, ordered by descending return on investment. <|endoftext|>
