Can you explain the concept of blockchain technology?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Blockchain is a decentralized database that is used to store information. It's made up of blocks that are linked together in a chain, hence the name "blockchain". Each block contains a set of data and a unique code called a hash. When a new block is created, it's connected to the previous block in the chain using the hash code. This creates an unbreakable chain of blocks that can't be altered or tampered with. <|endoftext|>
<|end|>
